"Well, you see," replied Kevin, "last night, after I finished my math homework, there was a problem."

10
00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.132
"Really? What kind of problem, Kevin?"

11
00:00:56.993 --> 00:00:57.513
said Ms.

