29
00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:30.844
He pulled me out onto his ladder and carried me to safety."

30
00:02:32.248 --> 00:02:34.609
Ms. Rose started to become suspicious.

31
00:02:34.629 --> 00:02:38.691
"You are very lucky," she said.

32
00:02:38.711 --> 00:02:40.852
"You could have been killed.

33
