Ms. Rose was about to catch Kevin.

48
00:03:50.913 --> 00:03:53.314
"Who was cooking at 10:30 p.m.?"

49
00:03:54.015 --> 00:03:54.815
she inquired.

50
00:03:54.835 --> 00:03:58.629
"My mother was cooking," answered Kevin.

51
00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:08.976
"But Kevin, you said that everyone was sleeping when the fire started," questioned Ms.

52
00:04:09.056 --> 00:04:14.540
Rose. "Well, yes, no.

53
00:04:15.501 --> 00:04:17.842
I forgot," stammered Kevin.

54
00:04:18.082 --> 00:04:21.024
"And Kevin," said Ms.

55
00:04:21.084 --> 00:04:27.693
Rose, "you said it was a loud fire and everyone saw it, but it was not on the

56
00:04:27.753 --> 00:04:28.633
news this morning."

57
00:04:28.653 --> 00:04:35.158
"Well, maybe it was too late for the news people," he replied.

58
00:04:35.178 --> 00:04:38.200
"Okay, Kevin," Ms.

59
00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.142
Rose said, knowing that Kevin was trapped.

60
00:04:41.162 --> 00:04:46.305
"I am going to call your mother to ask her if she needs any help from our class.

61
00:04:46.946 --> 00:04:49.447
Wait just a moment, and I'll be right back."

62
00:04:50.668 --> 00:04:52.770
"No!" pleaded Kevin.

63
00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.071
"Why not?"

64
00:04:55.632 --> 00:04:56.132
she asked.

65
00:04:57.004 --> 00:05:02.328
"Well, you see, my mother is "The truth!"

66
00:05:03.069 --> 00:05:03.829
demanded Ms.

67
00:05:03.869 --> 00:05:11.255
Rose. "There wasn't really a fire," Kevin admitted.

68
00:05:11.275 --> 00:05:17.880
"But you told us that your sister was hurt," said Suzy.

69
00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:23.664
"And you told us that you were rescued by a fire fighter," said Ted.

70
00:05:25.368 --> 00:05:30.790
