72
00:05:34.472 --> 00:05:36.253
shouted all the children.

73
00:05:38.654 --> 00:05:46.017
Ms. Rose looked at Kevin and explained, "Sometimes a small lie can grow into a big lie.

74
00:05:47.097 --> 00:05:48.718
You started with one lie.

75
00:05:49.218 --> 00:05:53.680
Then, because of your first lie, you needed to tell another lie.

76
00:05:55.088 --> 00:05:59.131
Those two lies led to another lie and then another lie.

77
00:06:00.252 --> 00:06:04.435
And this big lie means seven days detention for you, young man.

78
00:06:05.556 --> 00:06:07.457
So what did you learn today?"

79
00:06:08.018 --> 00:06:08.518
asked Ms.

80
00:06:08.578 --> 00:06:14.662
Rose. "I should tell the truth," said Kevin in a soft voice.

81
00:06:14.682 --> 00:06:16.624
"That's right.

82
00:06:17.384 --> 00:06:20.387
The more you lie, the more you need to lie."
